    "body": "As title, google sheet CSV format would put each column data as is if there is no comma inside and will wrap the column data inside double quote to differentiate with legitimate delimiter.\r\n\r\nI have gone through the help file but could not a way to do this. Not sure if the plugin supports this capability or not.\r\n```\r\nCol1,Col2,Col2\r\nData1,Data2,Data3\r\n\"Data1WithComma,OtherSide\",Data2,Data3\r\n```\r\ngAip,\r\n-> The first column of the second entry should be `\"Data1WithComma,OtherSide\"` and not `\"Data1WithComma`",
